    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d239-a1">

                <pb facs="0344" n="238" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg238"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 237.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCreery to Mr.
                            Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-11"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I herewith, transmit for your information
                    copy of a communication I had received from the governor of the province of
                    Valparaiso, transcribing a letter from the judge of crimes of this city, in
                    relation to the case of Patrick Shields.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. B. McCreery</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
